body: |-
  ## Where things stand (2026-10-15)
  - main = 86699265, version 7.15.0 (symbol integrity Phase 1 + live MCP context). npm still on 7.14.0 until founder publishes; MCP restart needed after.
  - Open queue carried into 8.0: symbol integrity Phase 2 (T-2026-10-13-002) and 3 (T-003); Warpline preconditions T-2026-10-14-001, evidence T-002, server v1 + runner + console T-003 (TD-2026-10-14-551, TD-2026-10-14-735).
  - Console design direction approved (Atelier session 2026-10-14-warpline-console); build gated on F4.

  ## Founder framing (verbatim)
  "other aspects of the space have matured enough that a grander vision may be in order and that's hit a crescendo for me with things like pewdiepie's odysseus and deepseeks 'deepseek-harness'"
  "we have neurons, constellation, paradigm, atelier, flows"
  "aspects to agentic engineering that i want to mesh in now: harness, mods and custom displays, agent / subagent notebook queyring and consolidation, loops (that all began with things like RALPH loops), interconnected claude sessions"
  "i know there is a world where a Paradigm Harness that meshes this world for those fully invested in this growing set of systems and tools would want and i think i want to make a real stride towards what this opensourced tool would be"
  "when we really get into it, i want us to go through a thorough atelier design deep session around it"
  Standing goal: "one day have an armada of separate instances working on code and they can all interoperate as well as with many developers on my team".

  ## Claude's added pieces (to debate, not decided)
  1. Replay + evals — every session re-runnable and scoreable (same instinct as Warpline's 1,000-PR replay).
  2. Budget governance — token/money/time ceilings per loop and per agent across the armada.
  3. Provenance + trust — signed attribution of who/what made each artifact (extends Warpline human keys).
  4. Handoff — clean human↔agent transfer of work both ways (console Inbox is a seed).
  5. Local models — open-source harness must run on a home box with no cloud.
  6. One identity across tools — same principal, session id and event bus in neurons, constellation, Warpline.

  ## Open question to founder
  Who is 8.0 for first: the founder's own armada, a dev team sharing a fabric, or open-source newcomers?

  ## Process
  Scouts → Fable divergent vision pass (Arky architecture, Loid learning-loop counterweights) → founder picks direction → Atelier deep session. Lore every decision and epiphany along the way.
